<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Plessey says sale statement in due course.</title>
<headline>Plessey says sale statement in due course.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plessey Corp Ltd said on Tuesday that it would make a further announcement on the disposal of its remaining consumer products interests &quot;in due course&quot;.</p>
<p>The company said last month it had reached an agreement with Omega Holdings Ltd for the sale. In March, Omega acquired Plessey's operations relating to marketing and distribution of Telefunken and Pioneer products in South Africa.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
